{"id":"yzvja5us9ivxqkyiqkne3pwk2","title":"高校图书馆数据库采购：流程、重点与难点","originalTitle":null,"summary":"高校图书馆的数据库采购已成为学校层面的资源治理问题，涉及续订、预算、采购方式、需求文件编制、谈判评审等七步闭环流程。重点在于与办学定位匹配、算清成本效益、用好集体议价以及把风险写进合同。难点包括价格剪刀差、市场竞争与天然垄断、绩效数据不可信、使用权而非所有权以及技术范式与治理协同的变化。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=213646&do=blog&id=1561457"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-17T02:02:37.475Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-17T02:02:37.475Z","category":null,"tags":["论文发表"],"score":17,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}